.TH start-cli-registry-admin-reader 1  "reader "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader \- Commands to add, list, edit, or remove registry reader keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli registry admin reader\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands to add, list, edit, or remove registry reader keys
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader\-add(1)
Register a key that private s9pks can grant read access to
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader\-edit(1)
Change the label of a registry reader key
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader\-list(1)
List registry reader keys
.TP
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader\-remove(1)
Remove a registry reader key and revoke it from every private s9pk
